# Website image and icon sources

- developer-workstation.png: AI-generated workstation illustration used as the profile avatar and English blog cover. It does not depict a real office or client project.
- favicon.ico, favicon.png and favicons/*.svg / *.png: white-backed Me wordmark created in code for this website. Theme colors come from src/lib/accent-themes.ts; generated by scripts/generate-favicons.mjs.
- images/posts/hello-world/*.webp: Unsplash photographs; source and license links are recorded in images/posts/hello-world/SOURCES.md.
- images/projects/pixpage/biker-cover.webp: Unsplash photograph; source and license links are recorded in images/projects/pixpage/SOURCES.md.

Unused template portraits, the template avatar and the superseded PixPage portrait cover were removed on 2026-10-21. The upstream code and content license notices remain in ../LICENSE and ../src/content/LICENSE.
